?meta	p1/sync/ctrl	xps:sw_reg	desc_str	Timing\_control\_register.\_Bit\_``0``:\_positive-edge\_sensitive\_enable\_allowing\_telescope\_time\_counter\_to\_be\_loaded\_from\_telescope\_time\_load\_registers\_on\_next\_synchronization\_pulse.\_Bit\_``1``:\_When\_transitioned\_from\_``0``\_to\_``1``,\_forces\_telescope\_time\_counter\_to\_be\_loaded\_from\_telescope\_time\_load\_registers\_immediately.\_Bit\_``2``:\_active\_high\_telescope\_time\_counter\_reset.\_Bit\_``3``:\_active\_high\_reset\_for\_error\_counters.\_Bit\_``4``:\_active\_high\_``arm``\_signal,\_which\_causes\_a\_global\_system\_reset,\_released\_on\_the\_next\_synchronization\_pulse;\_a\_system\_sync\_on\_the\_next\_synchronization\_pulse.\_Bit\_``5``:\_When\_transittioned\_from\_``0``\_to\_``1``,\_emulates\_the\_arrival\_of\_an\_external\_sync\_pulse.\_Bit\_``6``:\_When\_transittioned\_from\_``0``\_to\_``1``,\_arms\_noise\_generator\_seed\_loaders.\_Bit\_``7``:\_Positive-edge\_sensitive\_enable\_allowing\_telescope\_time\_counter\_to\_be\_loaded\_on\_next\_PPS\_pulse\_
